{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "COL",
  "chapter": 3,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "COL.3.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If then ye were raised together with Christ, seek the things that are above, where Christ is, seated on the right hand of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Set your mind on the things that are above, not on the things that are upon the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ye died, and your life is hid with Christ in God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When Christ, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " our life, shall be manifested, then shall ye also with him be manifested in glory.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Put to death therefore your members which are upon the earth: fornication, uncleanness, passion, evil desire, and covetousness, which is idolatry;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "for which things’ sake cometh the wrath of God upon the sons of disobedience:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "wherein ye also once walked, when ye lived in these things;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "but now do ye also put them all away: anger, wrath, malice, railing, shameful speaking out of your mouth:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "lie not one to another; seeing that ye have put off the old man with his doings,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and have put on the new man, that is being renewed unto knowledge after the image of him that created him:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "where there cannot be Greek and Jew, circumcision and uncircumcision, barbarian, Scythian, bondman, freeman; but Christ is all, and in all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Put on therefore, as God’s elect, holy and beloved, a heart of compassion, kindness, lowliness, meekness, longsuffering;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "forbearing one another, and forgiving each other, if any man have a complaint against any; even as the Lord forgave you, so also do ye:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and above all these things ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "put on",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " love, which is the bond of perfectness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And let the peace of Christ rule in your hearts, to the which also ye were called in one body; and be ye thankful.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let the word of Christ dwell in you richly; in all wisdom teaching and admonishing one another with psalms ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hymns ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " spiritual songs, singing with grace in your hearts unto God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And whatsoever ye do, in word or in deed, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "do",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all in the name of the Lord Jesus, giving thanks to God the Father through him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wives, be in subjection to your husbands, as is fitting in the Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Husbands, love your wives, and be not bitter against them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Children, obey your parents in all things, for this is well-pleasing in the Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Fathers, provoke not your children, that they be not discouraged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Servants, obey in all things them that are your masters according to the flesh; not with eye-service, as men-pleasers, but in singleness of heart, fearing the Lord:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "whatsoever ye do, work heartily, as unto the Lord, and not unto men;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "knowing that from the Lord ye shall receive the recompense of the inheritance: ye serve the Lord Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:COL.3.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he that doeth wrong shall receive again for the wrong that he hath done: and there is no respect of persons.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
